  "notes": "Desktop (Tauri-style) app rendered in the browser. Almost colourless white UI with a single hot-pink accent (#f35697) reserved for the primary 'Download all lyrics' pill, the big round play button, scrubber/volume thumbs and hover fill on row icon buttons. Lyrics status uses three distinct badge treatments: dark green 'Synced', near-black 'Plain' and an orange→purple gradient 'Word Synced' (the page's only gradients); tracks without lyrics show an empty cell. Buttons are fully rounded pills in light gray (#f5f5f5) with uppercase bold labels and small icons. No table borders or zebra striping—rows separated only by spacing; hovered row gets a faint outline. The album list (Album, 4–12 tracks per album, per-row download icons) exists behind the detail view in the DOM; the back button swaps it back in place. Content scrolls inside a panel between the fixed top bar and the bottom player."
